ets hurt - and it's never Vash.\n\nOddly enough, for such an infamous fugitive, there's no proof that he's ever taken a life. In fact, he's a pacifist with a doughnut obsession who's more doofus than desperado. There's a whole lot more to him than his reputation lets on - Vash the Stampede definitely ain't your typical outlaw.\n\n(Source: Funimation)"},"tags":[{"name":"Guns","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Fugitive","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cowboys","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":77,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Post-Apocalyptic","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crime","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Desert","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Travel","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Steampunk","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Twins","rank":68,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Shounen","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":62,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Space","rank":62,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":55,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Religion","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Acrobatics","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rural","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Body Horror","rank":40,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Trigun","english":"Trigun","native":"TRIGUN","romaji":"TRIGUN","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"枪神"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"トライガン"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Toraigan"}]},"trailer":{"id":"bJVyIXeUznY","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bJVyIXeUznY/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}